---
config:
  theme: default
  look: classic
---
swimlane-beta LR
  accTitle: Order approval
  accDescr: Customer submits an order, then staff review it and the system confirms it.
  subgraph customer [Customer]
    submit([Submit order])
    receive((Receive confirmation))
  end
  subgraph staff [Operations]
    review{Approve?}
    fulfill[Prepare shipment]
  end
  submit -->|New order| review
  review -->|Approved| fulfill
  fulfill -.->|Confirmation sent| receive
